    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_introduction.header": "Introduction to Physical Flanged Cogwheels",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_introduction.text_1": "Physical Flanged Cogwheels are the heart of Bits 'n' Tracks",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_introduction.text_2": "They come in 4 sizes...",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_introduction.text_3": "Large",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_introduction.text_4": "Medium",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_introduction.text_5": "Small",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_introduction.text_6": "Tiny",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_introduction.text_7": "... and 2 variants.",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_introduction.text_8": "Two cogwheels of the same size, placed end-to-end, create their wide version",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_introduction.text_9": "By right-clicking on a set number of cogwheels...",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_introduction.text_10": "You can create a track!",

    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.header": "Powering and managing Physical Flanged Cogwheels",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_1": "Before powering your track, you need to be aware of how it behaves",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_2": "Physical Flanged Cogwheels have distinct rotation ratios, and you will need to keep that in mind when creating a run of track",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_3": "Each cogwheel size has a different impact on stress. The bigger the cogwheel, the bigger the impact",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_4": "2x",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_5": "4x",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_6": "6x",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_7": "8x",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_8": "When connected together, the cogwheels will spin relative to the size of the powered cogwheel",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_9": "%s RPM",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_10": "%s RPM",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_11": "%s RPM",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_12": "%s RPM",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_13": "%s RPM",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_14": "And this is where you have to watch out",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_15": "Because if you spin a larger gear at a speed too high...",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_16": "%s RPM",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_17": "%s RPM",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_18": "%s RPM",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_19": "%s RPM",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_20": "%s RPM",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_21": "%s RPM",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.flanged_cogwheel_powering.text_22": "You can make the smaller cogwheels break!",

    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.header": "Introduction to Tracks",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_1": "Belts put the \"Tracks\" in Bits 'n' Tracks's name",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_2": "You can place a track on as many cogwheels as you want, starting from 2",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_3": "Belts also come in different styles, with 3 variants...",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_4": "... and 2 sizes",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_5": "By using the Cog Alignment Lever on a run of track...",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_6": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_7": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_8": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_9": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_10": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_11": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_12": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_13": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_14": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_15": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_16": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_17": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_18": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_19": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_20": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_21": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_22": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_23": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_24": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_25": "You can change the tension of the system",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.track_introduction.text_26": "This directly influences the track's behaviour, ranging from suspension implications to grip and terrain adaptability",

    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.header": "Using the Bits 'n' the Tracks with the Cog Alignment Lever",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_1": "In order to use the mod's track as a way to propel your vehicle across the world, you will need to use the Cog Alignment Lever",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_2": "So let's see it used on a test vehicle!",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_3": "In order to allow your cogwheels to tread the ground without sinking in it, you will need to §aenable§r them",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_4": "After you have enabled the needed cogwheels, wrap your track around them",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_5": "Remember to always add your belt after you've done all modifications needed to your trackset before assembling your contraption",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_6": "If you happen to forget something or want to add another cog to the system, right-click the run of track with the cog you want to include, and a placement hint will appear",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_7": "If at any point your track failed to assemble properly, or you changed it by adding or breaking a cogwheel, or you assembled it in the air, worry not! You can refresh it by right-clicking on it with the Cog Alignment Lever",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_8": "After you've checked everything is in order, you can assemble your contraption!",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_9": "As you can see, the cogwheels aren't sinking into the ground, because they had their collisions enabled",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_10": "Speed is determined by the RPM of the driving cogwheel",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_11": "The tracks can deform based on the ground they are treading, and how much they deform is determined by their tension",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_12": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_13": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_14": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_15": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_16": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_17": "A looser track means it can deform more, and it gains a slight grip buff based on the track links wrapping around an obstacle.",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_18": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_19": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_20": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_21": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_22": "%s",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.cog_alignment_lever_vehicle.text_23": "Bits 'n' Tracks tracks also have the special feature of having a determined amount of length given to them based on their tension"
}
